<BaseLayout
  title="E-Policy Bond on DigiLocker: Download, Legal Validity & Branch Acceptance"
  description="Your LIC bond on DigiLocker: how to download it from LIC's portal, whether DigiLocker treats it as equal to the original, why an uploaded copy is weaker than an issued one, and why the branch still asks for the original at claim time — plus the free e-insurance account alternative."
